# Build context is this repo, but the Dockerfile only COPYs app/… . Keep the
# context small: exclude everything, then re-include the vendored payload.
*
!app

# ...minus build-time-only / junk inside it.
app/**/node_modules
app/rendezvous/.wrangler
app/rendezvous/deno
app/public/sounds/_src
app/**/.DS_Store
app/.source-commit
